			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]キッド『ハチクマン！！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
